e": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Have you had a chance to talk to Janet?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. After your introductory offer, I must say we are ready to seal the deal. Would you be able to send Janet a copy before we sign off?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Certainly. I could be wrong but you've already seen the outline. I'll just fill in the amounts we've settled on.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Just as a reminder, I think we should jot a line about the training and personnel arrangements which we haven't discussed.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Indeed, I'll put a note here. I was wondering if you need to see any money upfront.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I could let Janet get back to you on that.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I understand that you have sent a man down to South America.", "time": "17000"}, {"image": "engenn7le09ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. This is the best method to do in depth market research, if you ask me. We also wanted to mention to you that Ferdinand will be staging the main PR events. We have agreed to provide media coverage for Holly's with simultaneous events that he will stage both in America and Brazil.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Ha! You've waited until now to inform me! I am experiencing firsthand why Polygon has a reputation for leadership in the market.  To be honest, it has certainly been a pleasure doing business with you.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Thank you for giving us the opportunity to work with you. I foresee a long-lasting partnership.", "time": "37500"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}